.. seealso:: :py:func:`errorMessage`
%End

    QString errorMessage() const;
%Docstring
Returns the descriptive error message, if an error was obtained while
converting the script.

.. seealso:: :py:func:`result`
%End

    QString expression() const;
%Docstring
Returns the QGIS expression equivalent of the Arcade script, if
